{"id":"en_fallen-prince-i-married-the-warrior-queen","title":"Fallen Prince? I Married the Warrior Queen","titleEn":"Fallen Prince? I Married the Warrior Queen","description":"Reborn as the Ninth Prince, disgraced and facing execution, he finds himself accused of treason and the slaughter of 100,000 soldiers. A letter written in blood becomes his means of turning the situation around, though it also forces him into a marriage with the empire's most powerful female war god. Concealing his real strength, he navigates the emperor's suspicions, wins over his formidable wife, defeats all who betray him, and ultimately ascends as the supreme martial master. Those interested in following this series can do so on Dramzio.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/fallen-prince-i-married-the-warrior-queen/en_US/aa64878db21a1516/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/fallen-prince-i-married-the-warrior-queen/en_US/aa64878db21a1516/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Ancient","Flash Marriage","Male","Mystical Fantasy","Obsessive Love","Palace"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dty58/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_fallen-prince-i-married-the-warrior-queen_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dty58/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_fallen-prince-i-married-the-warrior-queen_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dty58/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_fallen-prince-i-married-the-warrior-queen_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dty58/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id